break></color>攻击力的风属性伤害，随后吉尔伽美什获得<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>点【兴致】，<unbreak>Saber</unbreak>固定恢复<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>点能量并使自身下一次施放终结技时，造成的伤害为原伤害的<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#6[i]%</unbreak></color>。\\n施放<u>连携追加攻击</u>后清空累计攻击计数。","simple_desc":"吉尔伽美什或<unbreak>Saber</unbreak>攻击时累计攻击计数，任意单位攻击后若累计攻击计数达到<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak></color>，吉尔伽美什和<unbreak>Saber</unbreak>发动<u>连携追加攻击</u>，对敌方全体造成大量雷属性伤害以及大量风属性伤害，吉尔伽美什<color=#f29e38ff>获得<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak></color>点【兴致】</color>，<unbreak>Saber</unbreak>恢复能量并且额外提高下一次终结技的伤害。","type":null,"type_name":"天赋","tag":"群攻","sp_base":10,"sp_need":null,"bp_need":-1,"bp_add":null,"show_stance_list":[0,60,0],"stance_damage_type":"Thunder","stance_damage_display":20,"skill_need":null,"max_level":15,"rated_rank_id":null,"rated_skill_tree_id":null,"skill_combo_value_delta":null,"extra":{},"level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[2,3,3,120,8,1.2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[2.2,3.3,3,120,8,1.28]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[2.4,3.6,3,120,8,1.36]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[2.6,3.9,3,120,8,1.44]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[2.8,4.2,3,120,8,1.52]},"6":{"level":6,"param_list":[3,4.5,3,120,8,1.6]},"7":{"level":7,"param_list":[3.25,4.875,3,120,8,1.7]},"8":{"level":8,"param_list":[3.5,5.25,3,120,8,1.8]},"9":{"level":9,"param_list":[3.75,5.625,3,120,8,1.9]},"10":{"level":10,"param_list":[4,6,3,120,8,2]},"11":{"level":11,"param_list":[4.2,6.3,3,120,8,2.08]},"12":{"level":12,"param_list":[4.4,6.6,3,120,8,2.16]},"13":{"level":13,"param_list":[4.6,6.9,3,120,8,2.24]},"14":{"level":14,"param_list":[4.8,7.2,3,120,8,2.32]},"15":{"level":15,"param_list":[5,7.5,3,120,8,2.4]}}}},"skill_trees":{"Point01":{"1":{"anchor":"Point01","avatar_promotion_limit":null,"avatar_level_limit":null,"default_unlock":true,"icon":"skillicons/avatar/1509/SkillIcon_1509_Normal.png","level_up_skill_id":[150901],"material_list":[],"max_level":6,"param_list":[],"point_id":1509001,"point_name":"","point_desc":"","point_trigger_key":"PointNormal","point_typ